        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion SA-S7, Tubular Stainless Steel Leverset With Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis simple tubular stainless steel lever is made in contemporary design, using clean lines. It is available in brushed stainless steel and polished stainless steel finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion SA-S7 Simple Stainless Steel Lever With Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Stainless Steel Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>\"Positive Stop\" lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Simple SA-S7 Stainless Steel Lever With Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length:  5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection:  2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose:  2-7/8\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection:  3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\". Call Us For Doors From 2-1/8\" to 3\" Thick. </li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Simple Stainless Steel Leverset With Square Rose, Fusion SA-S&",
                "description": "Tubular Stainless Steel Leverset Fusion SA-S7 - This simple tubular stainless steel lever is made in contemporary design, using clean lines. It is available in Brushed Stainless Steel and Polished Stainless Steel finishes. It  can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
